WEBVTT

00:01.730 --> 00:03.630
An elite boy's school.

00:03.770 --> 00:06.740
I transferred after the semester began.

00:06.800 --> 00:09.530
I had no idea what was waiting for me.

00:09.810 --> 00:12.570
I thought it was just a school full of guys...

00:12.710 --> 00:13.900
...but why do I see a girl?

00:14.010 --> 00:15.070
I'm a guy!

00:15.180 --> 00:15.800
Huh?

00:15.910 --> 00:17.040
But that skirt...

00:17.110 --> 00:19.140
What are you saying?
You're going to wear it too.

00:19.250 --> 00:19.810
What?

00:19.920 --> 00:22.040
The three of us are in this together.

00:22.150 --> 00:23.880
Let's do a great job, okay?

00:23.990 --> 00:25.480
No!

00:25.890 --> 00:29.720
And this is how my life as a princess began...

00:30.160 --> 00:36.860
<i>After I met you, you shed</i> <i>some light onto my heart.</i>

00:36.970 --> 00:43.630
<i>I spent my days doing the</i> <i>same things all the time.</i>

00:44.570 --> 00:49.600
<i>I know what I want to</i> <i>say to you every time.</i>

00:49.750 --> 00:56.210
<i>I always have it</i> <i>hidden inside my heart.</i>

00:57.220 --> 01:01.950
<i>I know it's an important feeling...</i>

01:02.120 --> 01:07.650
<i>...and I'm keeping it warm</i> <i>to give it to you someday.</i>

01:09.930 --> 01:15.670
<i>The sound of the bells</i>
<i>I hear from far away...</i>

01:15.770 --> 01:22.580
<i>...makes my heart beat faster</i> <i>and cuts through the sky like a wind.</i>

01:22.710 --> 01:29.280
<i>After I met you, you shed</i> <i>some light onto my heart.</i>

01:29.350 --> 01:35.090
<i>I spent my days doing the</i> <i>same things all the time.</i>

01:35.290 --> 01:41.990
<i>And when it's time to tell you</i> <i>the things I've been wanting to say.</i>

01:42.130 --> 01:47.800
<i>You're my sunshine, an eternal smile!</i>

01:48.100 --> 01:58.100
<i>Our prologue, to this exciting story...</i>

02:00.180 --> 02:05.880
<i>The First Job, Princess Cheerleaders</i>

02:15.030 --> 02:17.630
Everyone!

02:24.670 --> 02:26.230
We're cheering for you!

02:31.650 --> 02:34.140
Best of luck with the league preliminaries!

02:43.390 --> 02:45.860
I didn't know it would be this big...

02:46.400 --> 02:48.390
We paid a visit to all the outdoor clubs right?

02:48.660 --> 02:49.360
Yeah.

02:49.430 --> 02:51.160
Now we visit the indoor clubs.

02:52.400 --> 02:56.170
Indoors could be the gymnasium, judo, the kendo dojo...

02:56.240 --> 02:57.870
Oh, and not to mention the archery club.

02:57.970 --> 02:59.840
Plus the swim team.

02:59.940 --> 03:01.910
There's a couple of cultural clubs as well.

03:02.040 --> 03:03.030
No...

03:03.180 --> 03:04.910
I don't like this...

03:05.910 --> 03:09.080
I won't go cheering outside!

03:09.280 --> 03:10.910
And so...

03:12.290 --> 03:14.620
Until the league preliminaries begin...

03:14.720 --> 03:17.630
...you three will go and cheer all of our clubs everyday.

03:17.730 --> 03:18.690
What?

03:18.790 --> 03:19.690
Everyday?

03:19.760 --> 03:20.920
All the clubs?

03:21.130 --> 03:24.400
Volleyball, basketball, ping pong, baseball, track, soccer, tennis...

03:24.470 --> 03:27.900
...kendo, judo, archery, and swimming, that's 11 for sports clubs.

03:28.140 --> 03:32.070
Brass band, chorus, shogi, and the computer club, that's 4 cultural clubs.

03:32.270 --> 03:33.740
15 clubs altogether.

03:34.110 --> 03:35.670
15?

03:36.680 --> 03:39.240
Take a look at this file for more details.

03:39.410 --> 03:40.710
Tendencies and measures?

03:40.780 --> 03:41.720
Right.

03:41.820 --> 03:45.720
It tells you details on how to praise those excellent club members.

03:45.950 --> 03:48.750
In order to raise the morale of the team, you need to cheer carefully...

03:48.860 --> 03:50.990
...then flatter and stir them up real good, that's how we push them.

03:51.130 --> 03:53.960
Did you stir them up as well?

03:54.060 --> 03:55.090
Of course!

03:55.800 --> 03:57.790
I felt like a famous actress when I stirred them up!

03:57.900 --> 03:59.830
Because of it, some of our students went to the prefectural tournament...

03:59.940 --> 04:01.730
...and even to the all-Japan tournament!

04:02.140 --> 04:02.970
I see!

04:03.310 --> 04:04.830
We have to dress like that outside as well?

04:04.970 --> 04:06.410
That's a bit harsh...

04:06.480 --> 04:10.940
Yeah, we're allowed to do this since it's kept away from the public.

04:11.010 --> 04:12.710
I won't do it!

04:12.780 --> 04:14.010
Don't worry.

04:14.120 --> 04:15.880
The league preliminaries are tightly scheduled...

04:15.980 --> 04:17.780
...so you can't possibly attend every event.

04:18.090 --> 04:21.750
It will be unfair for some clubs, so you don't have to go.

04:21.890 --> 04:22.910
Really?

04:22.990 --> 04:24.220
But...

04:24.490 --> 04:28.950
If they make it past the preliminaries, they will get cheerleaders.

04:30.030 --> 04:33.870
So if they want cheerleaders, then they have to win.

04:34.000 --> 04:35.440
That's what you're implying.

04:35.900 --> 04:38.200
So if they make it past the preliminaries...

04:38.310 --> 04:41.040
Well, think of it as a reward for the winners.

04:41.180 --> 04:42.770
How far did you go?

04:42.880 --> 04:43.970
I told you before.

04:44.080 --> 04:46.910
I went all the way to the all-Japan tournament.

04:48.150 --> 04:49.810
He was beautiful.

04:49.920 --> 04:52.850
I still have the image stuck in my mind.

04:52.950 --> 04:55.750
Even the opposing team was fascinated by him.

05:01.260 --> 05:02.320
Well?

05:02.530 --> 05:05.060
What if we have to go cheer for our clubs in public?

05:05.200 --> 05:08.070
We have no choice since the president told us to.

05:08.200 --> 05:09.030
Let's not do it!

05:09.140 --> 05:10.540
We won't do this cheerleading thing!

05:10.810 --> 05:12.000
We can't do that either.

05:12.070 --> 05:12.770
Why?

05:13.040 --> 05:15.510
If one of you decides not to do it, you're collectively responsible.

05:15.580 --> 05:17.810
Your privileges as a princess will be taken away.

05:17.910 --> 05:19.440
Remember that.

05:20.880 --> 05:24.080
If you decide not to do it, then we all suffer!

05:24.190 --> 05:27.160
I never wanted this or those privileges in the first place!

05:27.220 --> 05:28.490
It's too late to repent!

05:28.560 --> 05:31.360
How many times have we done this kind of thing?

05:31.560 --> 05:33.460
Then you want me to go out in public like this?

05:33.560 --> 05:34.760
I don't want to!

05:34.860 --> 05:36.390
Stop acting like a child!

05:36.500 --> 05:39.870
What is wrong with you Shihoudani?
You're always picking on me!

05:40.000 --> 05:41.530
That's because you're always being selfish!

05:41.600 --> 05:42.330
Yujirou...

05:43.470 --> 05:46.170
You don't have to force him if he doesn't want to.

05:46.240 --> 05:47.210
Kouno...

05:47.310 --> 05:48.280
Shihoudani!

05:48.610 --> 05:51.550
I've been wondering all this time but, you hate me don't you?

05:55.880 --> 05:56.440
Yeah.

05:57.920 --> 05:59.050
I'm kidding.

05:59.150 --> 05:59.880
What?

05:59.990 --> 06:03.390
Enough of this, let's try out the rest of our wardrobes.

06:03.890 --> 06:06.920
I hate you, Shihoudani!

06:07.400 --> 06:09.360
<i>Home Economics Room</i>

06:09.430 --> 06:11.830
And so...

06:11.900 --> 06:15.000
The next wardrobe we have is this nurse-like maid costume!

06:15.400 --> 06:17.800
I prepared it for this day!

06:15.940 --> 06:16.840
<i>Natasho!</i>

06:16.910 --> 06:17.800
<i>Calm down!</i>

06:17.910 --> 06:21.400
The theme is "The lovely maids serve the hard-working students!"

06:21.510 --> 06:23.170
This was Arisada's idea!

06:23.450 --> 06:24.570
The president's idea?

06:25.050 --> 06:27.540
I've already prepared for all the tournaments!

06:28.120 --> 06:29.950
A nurse costume for the league tournament!

06:30.050 --> 06:33.110
She will kindly heal those wounded fighters!

06:33.360 --> 06:35.350
Cheerleader costumes that will provide courage and strength...

06:35.460 --> 06:36.950
...during the prefectural tournament!

06:37.060 --> 06:38.890
And for the all-Japan tournament...

06:39.090 --> 06:42.000
A wedding dress to welcome the return of our fighters!

06:42.130 --> 06:42.960
No!

06:43.430 --> 06:44.260
Mikoto.

06:44.330 --> 06:45.930
Why don't you like it?

06:46.330 --> 06:47.600
It's a wedding dress!

06:47.870 --> 06:49.130
Wedding dress!

06:49.240 --> 06:51.500
Why do I have to get married?

06:51.970 --> 06:53.340
Don't make such a fuss.

06:53.510 --> 06:55.600
You always wear the princess costumes.

06:55.680 --> 06:57.310
But this is different!

06:57.410 --> 06:58.940
It's a wedding dress!

06:59.110 --> 07:01.350
Why do I have to be the wife of some guy?

07:01.450 --> 07:02.110
Childish...

07:02.350 --> 07:03.080
What?

07:03.150 --> 07:05.020
You're really acting like a child.

07:05.150 --> 07:07.550
You feel like you can do whatever you want.

07:07.660 --> 07:09.250
Shihoudani!

07:09.320 --> 07:10.660
You really don't...

07:10.960 --> 07:11.590
I hate you.

07:13.500 --> 07:15.400
I'm just kidding.

07:16.160 --> 07:18.130
You look like you're about to cry.

07:16.560 --> 07:19.500
<i>Not once, but twice you...</i>

07:18.300 --> 07:20.470
I don't hate you at all.

07:20.600 --> 07:21.430
It's just that...

07:21.540 --> 07:23.300
...you get on my nerves.

07:23.470 --> 07:25.910
Yujirou, you're pretty much saying the same thing.

07:25.970 --> 07:26.630
Really?

07:26.910 --> 07:29.240
I didn't mean any harm. Really.

07:29.540 --> 07:32.310
If I hated you, then I wouldn't even pick on you.

07:32.380 --> 07:34.680
I wouldn't call you by your real name, either.

07:34.980 --> 07:36.110
I mean, what is it?

07:36.220 --> 07:38.310
Do you want me to hate you, Mikoto?

07:40.120 --> 07:42.180
Anyway, what are we going to do?

07:42.290 --> 07:43.020
What?

07:43.190 --> 07:44.220
This is what I think.

07:44.330 --> 07:47.160
We can cheer them on and raise their morale...

07:47.230 --> 07:49.060
...but their performance won't get better, right?

07:49.160 --> 07:50.530
What is that supposed to mean?

07:50.630 --> 07:54.970
Another words, even if we cheer, the results are up to them.

07:55.070 --> 07:56.160
Ah, I see!

07:56.710 --> 07:59.000
If they don't get past the preliminaries, we don't have to do it!

07:59.110 --> 08:00.080
That's correct.

08:00.180 --> 08:01.270
It's not that easy.

08:01.380 --> 08:01.710
What?

08:02.010 --> 08:03.670
Princess!

08:07.050 --> 08:07.570
Right?

08:07.680 --> 08:10.020
They're all working really hard...

08:10.220 --> 08:11.450
Smile Mikoto!

08:11.550 --> 08:12.540
I know!

08:14.560 --> 08:15.520
Is this good?

08:15.590 --> 08:19.360
Gently place your hands on the hand that is holding the bat...

08:19.430 --> 08:21.260
Good. I think that's fine.

08:21.360 --> 08:22.660
I'll do my best!

08:24.330 --> 08:26.130
Is it okay if I let go?

08:26.230 --> 08:28.140
Ah, um, I...

08:28.340 --> 08:31.000
Are you sure this is okay?

08:31.110 --> 08:33.200
No, the hold doesn't go like that...

08:33.310 --> 08:34.570
I'm not talking about judo!

08:36.010 --> 08:36.710
Good.

08:36.980 --> 08:38.210
Good job princesses!

08:45.590 --> 08:46.490
I'm tired...

08:46.690 --> 08:50.180
We still have to keep going with this, right?

08:51.660 --> 08:53.560
Cheer up, Mikoto.

08:56.630 --> 09:00.160
But if we do things by the book given to us by the president...

09:00.270 --> 09:02.030
...is it really going to make a difference?

09:02.100 --> 09:03.330
Who knows.

09:03.440 --> 09:06.100
But they sure all look happy.

09:06.210 --> 09:07.040
I guess...

09:07.110 --> 09:07.700
Hey.

09:08.440 --> 09:09.500
Tsuji.

09:09.610 --> 09:11.580
Looks like you had a rough day.

09:11.680 --> 09:12.740
Umm...

09:13.010 --> 09:13.540
What's up?

09:13.620 --> 09:16.240
Can you do something about these seats?

09:21.190 --> 09:22.750
Don't complain too much.

09:23.120 --> 09:27.430
Even if it's inside the dorm, you have to act like a princess...

09:27.500 --> 09:29.490
...if the students can see you.

09:29.600 --> 09:30.330
I see...

09:30.500 --> 09:31.760
Well, good luck!

09:32.200 --> 09:33.360
Thanks.

09:34.740 --> 09:36.100
It's a job.

09:36.540 --> 09:38.300
We'll just have to do it.

09:39.140 --> 09:41.300
You're really into this, Kouno.

09:41.410 --> 09:41.810
What?

09:42.310 --> 09:44.180
You've only been here for such a short time...

09:44.280 --> 09:45.710
...and you had to be guided by us in the beginning.

09:45.810 --> 09:48.050
You really know what you're doing.

09:48.320 --> 09:50.310
You probably know more than me now.

09:50.420 --> 09:53.010
It's like you're now the second Shihoudani.

09:54.120 --> 09:56.790
It's better to get used to the environment as soon as possible, right?

09:57.060 --> 09:57.650
What?

09:58.560 --> 10:01.220
I know what to do in order to get used to all this.

10:01.700 --> 10:04.830
Things won't get any better if you act stubborn and rebel.

10:05.230 --> 10:08.800
Even if you have pride, it's just going to get in the way of things.

10:09.100 --> 10:14.600
In order to live, it's best to be what others want us to be...

10:16.410 --> 10:17.310
Kouno...

10:17.580 --> 10:19.170
I'm just kidding.

10:19.350 --> 10:21.710
I spoke in a roundabout way, so I'll say it in proverb.

10:21.820 --> 10:24.810
"When in Rome, do as Romans do."

10:25.290 --> 10:27.620
Rather than having others tell you what to do...

10:27.690 --> 10:30.780
...it's much easier if you think you're enjoying it, right?

10:31.360 --> 10:33.450
Why don't you do it with that feeling, Mikoto?

10:33.530 --> 10:34.660
It'll be fun.

10:34.730 --> 10:36.820
I wouldn't be troubled if that was possible.

10:37.100 --> 10:40.360
I don't know if I should call you honest or clumsy.

10:40.470 --> 10:42.200
Well excuse me!

10:51.880 --> 10:54.750
One week is just too much.

10:54.850 --> 10:57.150
No more. I can't move...

10:57.250 --> 10:57.840
Hey.

10:58.120 --> 10:59.310
Cheering again?

10:59.390 --> 11:01.480
Yeah, work and more work!

11:01.560 --> 11:02.550
Good job, guys.

11:02.660 --> 11:05.630
It's not like this cheering really makes a difference.

11:05.730 --> 11:07.390
That's not true.

11:07.500 --> 11:10.760
Every club member is really happy to hear you cheer for them.

11:10.930 --> 11:13.460
Since they're doing really well, they might...

11:13.570 --> 11:15.130
That just can't happen!

11:15.900 --> 11:16.770
Princesses!

11:18.170 --> 11:19.610
Princesses! We did it!

11:19.710 --> 11:21.770
We made it past the preliminaries!

11:21.880 --> 11:22.470
What?

11:36.220 --> 11:38.190
You did it, princesses!

11:39.390 --> 11:42.890
Our baseball club was the weakest club in Fujimori Academy.

11:43.330 --> 11:46.390
They've lost the last 10 years in the league preliminaries...

11:46.500 --> 11:49.600
...but I never imagined they'd be the first one into the next round.

11:50.170 --> 11:51.570
That's not all.

11:51.710 --> 11:53.370
Volleyball and basketball teams are winning as well.

11:53.740 --> 11:55.840
The track team is on their way to a new record.

11:56.280 --> 11:58.410
They're also winning matches in judo and kendo.

11:58.480 --> 12:00.680
Yes, it's simply amazing!

12:00.880 --> 12:02.940
It's all because of the princesses.

12:03.220 --> 12:04.210
Way to go princesses!

12:05.250 --> 12:07.590
It really worked...

12:07.690 --> 12:09.210
No way...

12:14.760 --> 12:16.660
And so...

12:16.970 --> 12:21.560
I want you princesses to head to the game next Sunday at 10 AM.

12:21.640 --> 12:22.470
Got it?

12:22.570 --> 12:24.940
We have no choice.

12:25.010 --> 12:27.500
If the president did it, then we have to do it.

12:27.840 --> 12:29.900
No! I won't do it!

12:29.980 --> 12:30.970
Mikoto!

12:31.250 --> 12:32.340
Are you kidding me?

12:32.450 --> 12:34.680
We can't go out in public looking like that!

12:34.780 --> 12:36.610
Mikoto!
<i>Here we go again.</i>

12:36.680 --> 12:39.310
You promised that we'll go cheering if they make it to the next round.

12:39.420 --> 12:41.450
I promised, but...

12:41.660 --> 12:44.920
But nobody thought they'd actually make it to the next round!

12:44.990 --> 12:46.550
You're right, but...

12:46.660 --> 12:47.630
See?

12:47.830 --> 12:51.560
I'm not the only one who feels uncomfortable going out in a dress!

12:51.670 --> 12:52.960
But you know...

12:53.230 --> 12:55.640
If you quit, the privileges you get for being a princess will be...

12:55.740 --> 12:56.470
What?

12:59.770 --> 13:03.270
What do you have to say about receiving benefits without doing any work?

13:03.340 --> 13:04.970
Well...

13:05.310 --> 13:09.650
I think that's more unmanly than dressing up like a princess.

13:10.750 --> 13:12.950
I think it's wrong too.

13:13.020 --> 13:15.290
I know it's wrong, but...

13:15.360 --> 13:17.590
...I don't want to look like a princess in public.

13:17.690 --> 13:20.560
Plus I really don't care much about the privileges!

13:20.660 --> 13:21.960
Shut up kid!

13:22.360 --> 13:23.960
You said it again!

13:24.030 --> 13:25.860
Don't be so selfish!

13:25.970 --> 13:27.760
Yujirou...

13:26.500 --> 13:27.760
<i>Yes, I'm selfish!</i>

13:27.870 --> 13:29.860
Calm down, you two.

13:28.370 --> 13:29.860
<i>Then change your attitude!</i>

13:29.970 --> 13:32.240
I wouldn't be troubled if
I could change that easily!

13:32.940 --> 13:34.000
Calm down.

13:36.340 --> 13:39.540
Anyway, I look forward to your cheers!

13:40.650 --> 13:41.780
Yes.

13:50.760 --> 13:54.720
<i>Bathhouse</i>

13:54.930 --> 13:57.130
<i>Princess Only</i>

14:18.650 --> 14:19.310
Princess!

14:19.390 --> 14:20.360
Good work!

14:20.460 --> 14:21.720
Guarding the princesses?

14:21.820 --> 14:23.290
It must be really hard for you.

14:23.390 --> 14:24.650
Are you kidding?

14:24.830 --> 14:27.990
There are so many guys who take pictures without permission...

14:28.100 --> 14:29.790
...as well as the rude ones...

14:30.030 --> 14:31.760
So this is what we do...

14:33.130 --> 14:34.900
See? Just like that.

14:34.970 --> 14:36.730
You're right...

14:43.110 --> 14:44.100
I'm out!

14:44.380 --> 14:45.570
You can go in now!

14:48.650 --> 14:51.080
Wasn't it a bit noisy just before?

14:51.350 --> 14:54.520
Yeah, the guards were a bit rough out there.

14:55.420 --> 14:57.820
It's not easy taking a bath around here...

14:58.430 --> 14:59.660
Yujirou...

14:59.890 --> 15:00.860
What is it?

15:00.960 --> 15:05.060
It's not nice to pick on
Mikoto like you did today.

15:06.430 --> 15:07.600
I guess.

15:07.670 --> 15:11.110
Oh, so you know it was wrong.

15:12.410 --> 15:13.670
I know.

15:14.140 --> 15:18.440
But I just have to pick on him for some reason.

15:18.550 --> 15:20.010
You actually like him.

15:20.110 --> 15:23.080
If you keep doing things that, he'll misunderstand your intentions.

15:23.150 --> 15:24.620
He'll start to think you really hate him.

15:24.690 --> 15:26.420
Maybe he already thinks that way.

15:26.490 --> 15:27.480
Yujirou!

15:27.590 --> 15:30.820
It's just that Mikoto is so honest...

15:36.630 --> 15:39.100
Is that why you want to pick on him?

15:39.200 --> 15:40.830
Don't you want to?

15:50.850 --> 15:52.140
What about me?

15:52.510 --> 15:54.180
Don't you want to pick on me?

15:54.450 --> 15:55.440
You are...

15:55.850 --> 15:57.440
You're different.

15:57.620 --> 16:00.820
You don't seem to know anything but you're difficult to deal with.

16:00.920 --> 16:02.580
You're just like me.

16:02.690 --> 16:03.560
I see.

16:03.660 --> 16:06.490
I won't ask you anything right now...

16:07.030 --> 16:11.160
I have a feeling Mikoto was really loved by his family.

16:11.700 --> 16:12.860
I'm jealous of him...

16:12.970 --> 16:15.990
You're right, that's why
I have to pick on him.

16:24.750 --> 16:27.870
Well, don't pick on him too much, okay?

16:30.620 --> 16:33.820
You're right, I'll keep it to a minimum.

16:49.040 --> 16:49.870
Not there?

16:50.240 --> 16:51.830
What do you mean Mikoto isn't there?

16:51.910 --> 16:53.740
He's nowhere to be found!

16:53.840 --> 16:56.780
But the game is about to begin soon!

16:57.110 --> 16:59.210
What are we going to do?

16:58.050 --> 16:59.210
<i>Well...</i>

16:59.280 --> 17:00.210
Yujirou!

17:00.850 --> 17:02.870
Mikoto didn't leave the premises.

17:02.980 --> 17:03.710
What?

17:03.780 --> 17:04.950
Then he must be...

17:05.190 --> 17:08.020
Could you go look around the dorm once more?

17:08.090 --> 17:09.520
Let's go, Tohru!

17:12.790 --> 17:13.730
Yujirou!

17:13.830 --> 17:15.230
Wait for me, Yujirou!

17:16.760 --> 17:17.990
Yujirou!

17:21.740 --> 17:23.230
What's wrong, Yujirou?

17:25.040 --> 17:27.700
Mikoto is somewhere on the premises.

17:28.080 --> 17:32.640
Judging from his personality, he's not going to break the rules.

17:32.750 --> 17:33.210
Right...

17:33.280 --> 17:36.050
I trust him 100%.

17:36.950 --> 17:38.040
Yujirou...

17:38.150 --> 17:43.610
He's always complaining, but he never fails to show up.

17:45.030 --> 17:47.960
Anyway, we'll be in trouble if we don't find him fast.

17:48.930 --> 17:51.590
If one of you decides not to do it, you're all collectively responsible.

17:51.700 --> 17:53.690
Your privileges as a princess will be taken away.

17:53.800 --> 17:55.100
Remember that.

17:56.840 --> 17:58.170
Let's go!

17:59.610 --> 18:00.130
Okay.

18:00.810 --> 18:01.710
Mikoto!

18:01.840 --> 18:02.640
Mikoto!

18:02.740 --> 18:03.940
Mikoto!

18:04.350 --> 18:05.280
Mikoto!

18:05.780 --> 18:06.800
Mikoto!

18:07.150 --> 18:08.280
Mikoto!

18:08.350 --> 18:10.180
Yujirou, it's time to go!

18:10.820 --> 18:12.720
Let's just give up and go!

18:12.820 --> 18:14.120
Are you sure about that?

18:14.620 --> 18:17.020
You don't care about the privileges?

18:22.360 --> 18:23.830
We have no choice.

18:24.330 --> 18:25.160
Kouno?

18:25.270 --> 18:27.700
Anyway, that's all we can do right now.

18:27.840 --> 18:29.700
Let's go change.

18:30.170 --> 18:31.160
Kouno!

18:32.370 --> 18:34.070
Wait a minute, Kouno!

18:34.270 --> 18:36.740
<i>Home Economics Room</i>

18:34.740 --> 18:36.010
Hurry up, Yujirou!

18:36.110 --> 18:36.740
Kouno!

18:40.180 --> 18:41.310
Mikoto...

18:47.360 --> 18:49.290
You were here since this morning?

18:49.620 --> 18:50.320
Yeah.

18:50.390 --> 18:51.590
Why?

18:51.660 --> 18:54.560
You told me I was unmanly right?

18:54.700 --> 18:57.960
You were definitely right, so I decided to reconsider.

18:58.070 --> 19:03.560
And like Kouno told me, I tried to do things on my own accord.

19:03.870 --> 19:08.170
So I came early this morning, and tried to put on my costume, but...

19:09.880 --> 19:11.140
Mikoto...

19:11.210 --> 19:15.050
Then you were terribly distressed, since you couldn't decide what to do?

19:15.150 --> 19:16.620
But it's a nurse costume!

19:16.680 --> 19:17.710
Nurse!

19:17.820 --> 19:20.010
You think it's easy for me to wear this?

19:21.190 --> 19:22.620
Okay, time's up.

19:22.690 --> 19:23.890
Let's change, Mikoto.

19:23.990 --> 19:26.050
What? But I'm not ready...

19:24.790 --> 19:26.060
<i>Look at the time!</i>

19:26.390 --> 19:28.120
No more discussion!

19:28.230 --> 19:29.660
We won't make it if we don't hurry!

19:29.760 --> 19:31.030
Raise your arm!

19:31.130 --> 19:32.660
Don't be embarrassed!

19:42.880 --> 19:44.970
We're hopeless! We can't win...

19:45.080 --> 19:46.010
We can't win!

19:46.080 --> 19:47.740
Everyone!

20:03.060 --> 20:04.930
Sorry to keep you guys waiting.

20:05.100 --> 20:07.030
Don't give up just yet.

20:07.370 --> 20:10.300
We'll do our best to cheer for you.

20:10.710 --> 20:14.230
So don't give up! Give it your best!

20:20.720 --> 20:21.740
Strike! Batter out!

20:22.820 --> 20:23.410
Out!

20:23.680 --> 20:24.910
That's 3 outs!

20:29.790 --> 20:30.850
And that's a game!

20:30.960 --> 20:33.450
Fujimori Academy wins 22-9!

20:38.800 --> 20:41.700
<i>Reserved for the Princesses</i>

20:45.310 --> 20:48.140
The bigger the bath, the better.

20:48.480 --> 20:51.710
Aren't you glad we got a bigger bath as a reward?

20:51.780 --> 20:53.750
We went through such a humiliating act.

20:53.850 --> 20:55.410
They definitely should give us this kind of treatment!

20:55.520 --> 20:58.110
It'll be messed up if they didn't let us use this bath!

20:58.220 --> 20:59.690
You're right but...

20:59.990 --> 21:04.930
Anyway, both the soccer club and the brass band got to the next round.

21:04.990 --> 21:05.690
What?

21:05.790 --> 21:08.060
And the tennis club as well.

21:08.260 --> 21:09.290
Wait a minute!

21:09.460 --> 21:12.020
Does this mean we have to go out in public again?

21:12.130 --> 21:13.470
Don't think about running away this time.

21:13.530 --> 21:14.700
Shihoudani!

21:14.800 --> 21:15.770
Mikoto!

21:15.900 --> 21:17.200
You're acting unmanly!

21:17.540 --> 21:20.010
Let's do our cheers again tomorrow!

21:20.110 --> 21:21.840
Say something, Kouno!

21:21.940 --> 21:23.770
Get over it.

21:23.910 --> 21:24.740
Kouno!

21:26.310 --> 21:27.410
Come on!

21:27.520 --> 21:28.480
Childish...

21:29.080 --> 21:31.180
What did you say?

21:29.920 --> 21:31.180
<i>Shut up kid!</i>

21:31.290 --> 21:33.120
You said it again!

21:41.830 --> 21:49.290
<i>If you're sad and feeling</i> <i>down, then call out to me.</i>

21:49.370 --> 21:57.440
<i>I'll be in the area, so let</i> <i>me know what's bothering you.</i>

21:58.050 --> 22:05.350
<i>If you're all by yourself,</i> <i>then you'll forget how to smile.</i>

22:05.420 --> 22:13.190
<i>A smile is something you</i> <i>share with another person.</i>

22:13.260 --> 22:23.260
<i>Hey, the future you can see</i> <i>from the classroom window...</i>

22:23.440 --> 22:30.170
<i>...is getting larger after</i> <i>taking in the sunlight.</i>

22:30.440 --> 22:32.040
<i>Smile at me!</i>

22:32.150 --> 22:39.920
<i>A smile is what makes you feel energetic!</i>

22:40.020 --> 22:46.090
<i>I want to give some smiles to you...</i>

22:46.190 --> 22:48.160
<i>...right away.</i>

22:48.400 --> 22:58.390
<i>In order for you to lift</i> <i>your head up and start walking.</i>

23:05.050 --> 23:10.010
Next Episode-Yujirou's Past
